    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, assuming our can deliver the project within our standard cost structures and efficiently manage resources and expenses, aiming for the higher end of our target gross margin range (closer to 35%) seems achievable, given the controlled annual operating costs and the total contract value of €900,000 over 5 years. aiming would place our projected revenue after costs in a favorable position, allowing our to meet our financial goals while delivering value to the client within the client budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI assistance solution that facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide explainable recommendations or suggestions and be designed as a non-decisional support tool." ;
