    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, weropose an AI assistance solution that leverages we retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. our retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities allows for hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, and structured extraction, which can facilitate access to information and improve the quality of written outputs. we ai_llm_rag_capabilities are grounded in the organization's own validated documents, including care protocols, HAS recommendations, internal procedures, regulatory texts, and internal guides. grounded ensures that The solution provides explainable recommendations or suggestions, as every answer generated by we system cites the retrieved passages used to create every answer generated by our system. we can design The solution as a non-decisional support tool, where the assistant proposes and the professional validates, consistent with HAS guidance. we approach is iterative, involving corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and an evaluation loop to ensure the quality of The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we can propose a progressive deployment, starting with a pilot phase in one or two departments, followed by gradual generalization to all services. propose allows we to test and refine The solution while minimizing disruption to clinical and administrative workflows. we model options include a sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) that provides strong grounding behavior and is well-suited to explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements. we can also consider top-tier proprietary models (via API) for higher performance on complex generative tasks, although top-tier proprietary models (via API) for higher performance on complex generative tasks may have lower internal transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we RAG capabilities and iterative approach, we believe we can provide an AI assistance solution that meets the client's requirements for facilitating access to information, improving written outputs, reducing processing times, and providing explainable recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

